        "markdown": "# Lagoon Spa & Wellness\n\nA quiet spa on the lagoon in Grand Cul-de-Sac. Massages, facials and a hammam, with treatments in-spa or at your villa.\n\n## Treatments\n\n- Signature lagoon massage — 60 min — $160 / 90 min — $220\n- Deep tissue massage — 60 min — $170\n- Hydrating facial — 50 min — $150\n- Couples massage — 60 min — $320 for two\n- Hammam ritual with body scrub — 75 min — $190\n\nVilla visits: add $50 per therapist.\n\n## Hours\n\nOpen every day from 9am to 7pm. Last appointment at 6pm.\n\n## Booking\n\nBook on Mindbody: https://www.mindbody.example/lagoon-spa or call +590 590 00 27 89. WhatsApp +590 690 00 27 89.\n\n## Our therapists\n\n- Nadia Benali, spa manager\n- Chloé Martin, massage therapist\n- Sofia Reyes, aesthetician\n\n\"The hammam ritual was the highlight of our honeymoon.\" — Olivia & James, New York\n\nLagoon Spa & Wellness, Grand Cul-de-Sac, 97133 Saint-Barthélemy · info@lagoonspa.example\n\nEnglish, French and Spanish spoken. Free parking. Gift vouchers available.\n\nThis site uses cookies. © Lagoon Spa & Wellness"
